@baseUrl = http://localhost:5002

### Distribute release 1 to Spotify
POST {{baseUrl}}/releases/1/distribute/Spotify

### Distribute release 1 to Anghami
POST {{baseUrl}}/releases/1/distribute/Anghami

### Distribute release 1 to Apple Music
POST {{baseUrl}}/releases/1/distribute/AppleMusic

### Distribute release 1 to YouTube Music (added in Phase 4 with no registration changes)
POST {{baseUrl}}/releases/1/distribute/YouTubeMusic

### Distribute release 2 to every DSP at once
POST {{baseUrl}}/releases/2/distribute-all

### Unknown DSP -> 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/releases/1/distribute/TikTok

### Release that does not exist -> 404
POST {{baseUrl}}/releases/99/distribute/Spotify
